# ── AARCH64 / SNAPDRAGON-X TODO (not yet resolvable from the offline mirror) ──
# These are required but live in the AUR or need a Snapdragon-specific source,
# so they cannot be downloaded by the ISO's `pacman -Syw` offline-mirror step.
# Handle them via an AUR packaging script (yay) or a custom repo — see
# docs/summary-of-changes.md §4/§6. Listed here so they are not forgotten:
#
#   linux-x1e (or patched aarch64 kernel)  # replaces generic `linux` above
#   qualcomm firmware (ath12k Wi-Fi, Adreno A7xx)  # confirm exact set
#   walker            # keyboard-first launcher (wlroots-native)
#   yay               # AUR helper (replaces removed yay-debug)
#   displaylink       # Plugable DisplayLink adapter
